window.products.push({"id":1138032,"name":"KEEP PURSUING KP Sling Bag Jet Black with Orange Interior","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51nqmuZK2qL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product Description KP Sling - The Everyday Adventure Bag From the Manufacturer Great Storage Capacity Perfect for keeping all your daily essentials - smart phone, keys, portable charger, water bottle, small tablet, cables and room for more. Center Padded Compartment Great for keeping your electronics safe and protected. Fits an Amazon Kindle Fire HDX or iPad Mini perfectly. Zipper Loop Locks A simple and smart design to secure your valuables in the Sling. Water Resistant Makes the bag usable in all weather conditions and also easy to clean. High-Quality Hardware All the components on the bag are made of a high-quality Zamak 5 Zinc Alloy. 6 Colors To Choose From Let the Sling match your personality and style About the Startup Describe your product in 3 words. Everyday Adventure Bag How did you come up with the idea for this product? With everything you have to carry nowadays it is just too much stuff to put in your pockets, however it isn't necessarily enough that you need to carry a massive backpack. We wanted to create a bag that was the perfect size to carry all your daily tech-essentials. What makes your product special? There are a lot of everyday carry bags out there, but we wanted to create a bag for people who are active. Not only is the bag extremely durable but the way it fits your body makes it ideal for activities like riding your bike, hiking, skateboarding and more. Plus with the additional waist strap you can keep the bag securely in place. What has been the best part of your startup experience? Seeing all the amazing feedback and response from people online has been extremely rewarding. Knowing people love the bag really makes us feel proud!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51nqmuZK2qL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Keep Pursuing","source_asin":"B015HOKNKU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1138032","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B015HOKNKU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B015HOKNKU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
