window.products.push({"id":1138137,"name":"By Luck Travel Coffee Mug 16oz - Vacuum Stainless Steel Insulated Coffee Travel Mug Spill Proof and Leakproof Lid, BPA Free, Double Walled Reusable Tu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6124Jgp+v4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【360° LeakProof Cup Lid】:The flip clip on the lid closes using a the Silicone hole stopper and silicone seal inside the lid that achieves a 360° Leak Proof and Spill Proof drinking, this will always keep your bag and car dry. The coffee mug is very easy to use. The lid can be controlled with one hand when you're in the car. You can easily open and lock down the drink hole stopper and enjoy your coffee. 【Double vacuum insulation】:The 304 stainless steel double wall vacuum insulated travel coffee mug reduces heat loss and keeps your drink hot for a long time, while also being scald proof. Hot drinks like hot tea or hot coffee stay hot for up to 6 hours, and cold drinks like iced juice or iced coffee stay cold for up to 10 hours. This way, you can enjoy better drinks at any time. 【High Quality & BPA Free】:100% FDA food grade stainless steel, BPA free and odorless, so you can be safe from toxins. Using reusable, sturdy and durable coffee cups instead of using disposable plastic cups will better protect the environment. The external removable silicone sleeve is non-slip and comfortable to hold, It is recommended to hand wash the coffee thermos not to put it in the dishwasher to clean it, because the high temperature will damage the outer coating of the coffee mug. 【Suitable for car cup holder】: Size: 7.28 x 3.15 x 2.75 inch, the portable 16 oz insulated coffee travel mug fits most car cup holders. Perfect for accompanying you on your daily life, ideal for indoor and outdoor activities such as home, office, parties, travel, camping and picnics, etc. Also stylish and elegant with excellent insulation properties the coffee mug is perfect as a gift for your family, loved ones and friends. 【After-sales service】:If you have any questions about our coffee thermos, please feel free to contact us. We will be happy to solve your problem. 90 days refund or return is provided.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6124Jgp+v4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"By Luck","source_asin":"B0BL2PXDH1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1138137","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BL2PXDH1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BL2PXDH1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
