window.products.push({"id":1138230,"name":"Supla Faux Silver Dollar Eucalyptus Garland Artficial Mixed Greenery Arch Swag Flowers Twig Garland Seeded Eucalyptus Backdrop Garland Doorways Farmho","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MhWph3h2L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Quantity: This mixed Mixed Greenery Swag farmhouse garland uses a mix of faux greenery, including seeded silver dollar eucalyptus, boxwood, seeded Eucalyptus, to create a rich blend of colors and textures. The garland has a hanging loop at each end for easy using. Dimensions: Artificial mixed Eucalyptus leave Garland measures appr. 3.9 feet in length and 7.9\" in width. Leaves are in assorted sizes that range from 0.5\" to 5.7\" in length and 0.2\" to 2.2\" in width. The gypsophila flowers are appr. 0.6\" in diameter. Delicate Eucalyptus Garland: This artificial eucalyptus garland is crafted with silk and plastic material, looking just like real plants with its fine details. The stem is wired, which means you can arrange the garland into your preference and it will maintain its position. Artificial eucalyptus plant requires no maintenance, no watering and no pruning yet will remain just as fresh-looking year after year. Use for Home Décor: Faux eucalyptus greenery garland is ideal for placing on the fireplace mantel, draping over mirrors, windows, framed pictures, winding around pillars, railings, gazebos, banisters, trellis, pergola, arranging atop cabinets, or hanging from ceiling and wall. It will make any plain or dull space come alive and ready to thrive. Beautiful Wedding Greenery: The hanging eucalyptus leaves garland is perfect for wedding backdrop, floral chandeliers, chair decorations, aisle runner décor, wedding sign topper, wreath, hanging ceiling vines, flower girl accessories, banquet table runner, table centerpiece cover, archways decorations, photo booth backdrop, and more. It is sure to bring that natural beauty to your special day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MhWph3h2L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Supla","source_asin":"B07T632PCK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1138230","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07T632PCK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07T632PCK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1138231,"name":"Silipint Silicone Bowl with Lid, Unbreakable, Durable Bowl for Storage, Mixing, Serving and Eating. Non-Slip and Easy Grip. Great for Indoor and Outdo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51iHcGSMhQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SILICONE BOWL & LID: Ultra versatile and durable, our Lidded Bowls come with an airtight closure that is still easy to take on and off. Use for mixing, serving, storage, heating, freezing, eating, sharing and more!! It’s pretty much a miracle bowl!! Lightweight and easy to pack for travel and outdoor use. This unbreakable bowl is colorful, versatile, flexible, and fun to use! 100% SAFE, FOOD-GRADE SILICONE: Silipint products are safe and built to last! They are made of 100% food-grade platinum-cured silicone that is free of BPA, odors and phthalates. Each reusable Bowl and Lid is dishwasher safe, freezer friendly, and microwave safe. They will never break, crack, chip, dent, fade, or scratch. ADVENTURE READY: These Bowls with Lids are up to any challenge. They are great for Barbeques and Picnics at Home, and even better while Camping, at the Pool or Beach and even on a Boat. Colors that pack the fun and will never fade. EARTH-FRIENDLY: Silicone is made from common and very abundant materials and is completely sustainable and earth-friendly. Silicone tableware can replace plastic or paper and reduce waste. Switching to silicone cups, tumblers, bowls, and straws can help ease the strain on the earth and help you do your part to support a cleaner planet. THE ORIGINAL SILICONE DRINKWARE: Silipint offers shatterproof reusable cups, shot glasses, wine glasses, and tableware with endless uses for endless fun! All our products are stylish, durable, easy to enjoy and yes - Guaranteed for Life!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51iHcGSMhQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Silipint","source_asin":"B09C664K91","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1138231","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09C664K91","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09C664K91","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
