window.products.push({"id":1138235,"name":"Home Accents Picture Frame / Photo Frame 4 x 6 (Distressed Ivory)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91oZSVvCP3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add a touch of Parisian charm to any room in your home with this ornate metal scrolled photo frame from Home Accents. The Home Accents Picture Frame / Photo Frame 4 x 6 is made from plated metal and features a unique cut out scroll pattern that gives it a pretty, vintage look and surrounds a rectangular 4” x 6” photo cut out in the center. Reminiscent of the details you might see in a sweet swelling French patisserie, this frame is part of the French Bistro Photo Frame Collection and is available in a variety of hand polished metal finishes that have been carefully treated for tarnish resistance. Choose from a blue and grey finish, a distressed black finish, and an ivory finish with heavily distressed accents and chipped paint that make it look as if it has survived generations of use. This pretty picture frame has a sweet, feminine sensibility with its delicately scrolled metal details, narrow frame border, and elevated photo inset. Hang one on a wall to create a beautiful display that not only speaks to your personal sense of style but lets you highlight an image that is meaningful and treasured in your home. Place one on a bedside table so that you can take a glimpse at your favorite photo each night before going to sleep. Combine two or more with other vintage accents to create a unique decorative display on a bookshelf or on a mantel over your fireplace. This frame is special enough to hold a photo from an important event such as a wedding or an anniversary, a special school photo of your child, or a treasured image of a beloved relative or an ancestor from years ago. It is also casual enough to hold a playful group shot of friends, a whimsical photo of your favorite pet, or an action shot from a day at the beach or a ski run down the slopes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91oZSVvCP3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home Accents","source_asin":"B00R1OE6L2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1138235","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00R1OE6L2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00R1OE6L2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
