window.products.push({"id":1138255,"name":"Anothera 17.5\"x15.5\"x1.5\" 2Pack Concrete Molds Reusable Walk Path Maker Paving DIY Path Garden Yard Patio Mold (10-Grid)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":50.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811aT8qzp8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【FOR WHAT】The paving path/border maker are designed for those wishing to create their own unique path,patio ,Yard and Lawn. 【EASY TO USE】No professional skills or special tools are required. Even you have no experience can build a beautiful pathway. 【REUSABLE】The walkway molds is made of heavy-duty polypropylene.Just clean it with water before the concrete is solidified, and it can be reused over and over again. 【DIYERS’ BEST HELPER】The pavement mold is unique irregular brick shape and everyone can design a beautiful walkway with it, and enjoy DIY with family. 【SIZE】17.5\"x15.5\"x1.5\" (Length*Width*Thickness)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811aT8qzp8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Anothera","source_asin":"B09WYCPSXC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1138255","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WYCPSXC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WYCPSXC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1138256,"name":"7\" Mini Air Conditioner, BALKO Air Conditioner Portable for Room, 2000mAh Rechargeable Battery & USB Personal Air Cooler Fan w/Humidifier, 3 Speed, Ev","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71O1d6aoXHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❆【3-IN-1 Fan/Humidifier/Cooler】BALKO desk air conditioner has a variety of ways of use, natural air, cool air, and cool mist air, which can meet your different needs in different situations. Winter humidification air. When the weather is not so hot, it can be used as a regular fan. Or add water & ice to the top tank to get cool wind. (Can't cool down the entire room, only cool a personal space the size of a bed.) ❄【USB Charging & Wireless Use】The built-in 2000mAh rechargeable lithium-ion battery of this small air cooler can provide a super long cooling time experience, which can run wirelessly for up to 3~5 hours after full charging. 6.56FT USB-Type C charging cable cord included can be connected to an adapter, power bank, computer, or car charger, no matter, anywhere, anytime, perfect for home, room, office, kitchen, car, and outdoors. ❄【265ml Water Tank for Extra Cooling】With a 265ml big water tank, the personal air conditioner can work continuously for 3-5 hours when filled with water (running time is dependent on ambient humidity), avoiding frequent water refills, and automatically switching to the natural wind when the water runs out, so you don't have to worry about falling asleep. The water level window allows you to check and control the water level at any time. The top water tank design increases the convenience of adding water and prevents water leakage. ❄【Portable & Compact Design For Everywhere】The portable air conditioner is sized only 5.9*6.3*6.9 inches, great for tight spots and providing unlimited usage possibilities. The compact and lightweight design makes it easy to carry and store when not in use. Weighing only 2.23 lbs, the equivalent of 3 apples, you can take this portable AC unit in your bag anytime, anywhere. Picnics, RVs, fishing, golf courses, garages, and more. ❄【Convenient Button Controls】BALKO mini air conditioner is equipped with easy-to-use button controls to switch between the 3-wind speed setting (Low/Mid/High), mist settings, and a built-in 3 LED indicator - everything you need to operate your cooler, in one place. With easy to understand icon on the panel, it is friendly to seniors who are unfamiliar with smart appliances. If you have any questions about the small air conditioners, you can contact us at any time via Amazon, and we will reply to you within 24 hours. ❄【Efficient Cooling & Atomization】camping air conditioners are equipped with a high-performance motor and a unique mist setting, which are able to reduce the surrounding temperature up to 35-42℉ and within 3 seconds provide you a powerful, cool, natural airflow. Moreover, you can also add cold water or ice cubes on top for a better cold breeze. (❄Please Note: small portable air conditioner can only cool the user's surrounding environment. Do not expected to have the same effect as a large air cooler.) ❄【Quiet & Gentle Breeze】This battery-powered air conditioner uses a crossflow impeller wheel design to eliminate fan noise (<48dB) to deliver ultra-quiet cooling, leaving your sleep or work in the room always undisturbed during hot summer days and nights. The safety grill on the air outlet offers extra protection to shut out curious fingers and paws, perfect for families with children and pets. ❄【Eco-Friendly Perfect Summer Gift for Friends】Are you still worried about the electricity bill of the air conditioner this summer? BALKO mini air cooler can keep you cool while lowering your bills, which consumes only 6.5 watts, and only uses 0.156 kWh for cooling for a full day (24 hours), while a BTU air conditioner will consume up to 1.2 kWh for just 1 hour of operation.In summer, it is definitely the coolest and most practical gift for you, your family, and your friends. ❄【3 LED Indicator】Normally green: gear position indicator 3LED participates in operation, low, medium, and high gears, in order from left to right. Green flashing: charging indication, left 1LED flashing 2.8-3.26V, 2LED flashing 3.26-3.7V, 3LED flashing 4.1V. Red flashing: low battery reminder, flashing red, left 1LED participating in the operation, low battery reminder 2.8-3V. No operation for the 60S (You can also turn off the lights), enter the screen off protection and touch it to wake up. And wonderful for your night. *NOTE: Due to the long shipping distance and storage time in our warehouse, the desk fans you received may need to be fully charged for 3-4 hours before its initial use. Once the unit has been fully charged, you should be able to use it as intended. BALKO provides professional customer service, any problem, just feel free to contact us via Amazon or the hotline printed on the user manual and we will reply to you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71O1d6aoXHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BALKO","source_asin":"B0BPPCPFSF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1138256","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPPCPFSF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPPCPFSF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
