window.products.push({"id":1138442,"name":"FEILANDUO Over The Door Organizer Boho Macrame Closet Organizers and Storage with 3 Large Woven Pockets Behind Door Organizer for Nursery, Pantry, Bat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QQH5Q0azL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Unique Boho Decor: This over door organizer comes with a 3-tier woven basket and 2 large pockets that help organize and sort various types of items. The chic macrame weave pattern plays a decorative role in storage. Stereo Closet Door Organizer: Door storage organizer maximize unused space and add extra room. Hanging folder organizer can neatly store cosmetics,baby essentials and sort socks, diapers, baby cloths, underwear, hygiene products and more. Easy To Install: To use over the door organizer, you only need simply hang the closet hanging organizer and storage over interior door or closet door(suitable for 1.75inch standard door).Door mounted nursery pegs are perfect for nurseries, bathrooms, storage rooms, laundry rooms, playrooms, apartments, and more. Durable Material: The door hanger is made of durable cotton canvas and the hanging organizer has PE plates on the bottom of each pocket to hold its shape well. Please do not machine wash, take out the plastic plates before washing. Size: Total size of closet organizers and storage: 34''High x 13''Length x 4.7''Width. the size of each woven baskets: 13''Length x 4.3''Width x 5.5''High, the size of each pocket:6.3''Length x 0.78''Width x 7''High, . Please Note: the metal hooks suitable for doors less than 1.77 inches in thickness. And suitable for crack in the door more than 0.66 inch.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QQH5Q0azL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FEILANDUO","source_asin":"B0BGL3MC4B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1138442","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGL3MC4B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGL3MC4B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1138443,"name":"Kleer-Vu Photo / Memo Album with Window, Wedding Moire Collection, White, Holds 200 5x7 Photos, 2 Photos Per Page.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qSs+9JqnL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"The cover is made of a beautiful patterned synthetic fabric with an opening on the front to slip in a photo. Each of the fifty sheets contained within have slip in pockets to hold 2 horizontal 5\"X 7\" photos with a memo area beside each photo with which to record that special moment. The album exudes quality in materials and workmanship and requires very little up-keep. Available in White only at this time. The cover is sure to give you a smile while you enjoy or share your photos. This collection really is a gift for wedding occasion and allows the consumer to associate wedding theme with it. Materials are archival, photo safe, acid & PVC free. All pages are archival.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qSs+9JqnL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KVD","source_asin":"B008BA8B5C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1138443","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008BA8B5C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008BA8B5C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
