window.products.push({"id":1138516,"name":"Teabloom All-Purpose Beverage Tumbler – 15 oz / 450 ml Insulated Glass Bottle – Tea, Coffee, Fruit Infused Water – All-Temperature Travel Mug – Stainl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Z7eq9ekTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"STREAMLINE YOUR LIFE with a beautifully-made, sustainable, all-purpose glass tumbler. The Wayfarer is the only travel beverage container you’ll ever need – a combination of tea infuser, coffee thermos, cold brew coffee maker, fruit water infuser, sports water bottle, and more. ENJOY MORE VERSATILITY. The Wayfarer's innovative stainless steel two-way filter is perfect for brewing hot and cold tea and cold-brewed coffee and filtering fruit-infused water. Standard infusers have 1mm holes – ours are .5mm for a more refined brew. The removable sleeve offers an added level of insulation. SAVOR SMART, FUNCTIONAL DESIGN. The Wayfarer holds 450 ml (15 oz) and is exquisitely crafted with a durable, double-wall borosilicate glass interior and beautiful rose-gold metallic details. Borosilicate glass is resistant to stains, odors, and corrosion. Slim design fits all car cupholders. BE KIND TO YOURSELF AND THE EARTH. Take on the throw-away cup culture. Using the Wayfarer every day instead of a disposable cup can save up to 23 lbs of trash every year and 88 lbs of C02 emissions. BE KIND TO SOMEONE YOU LOVE. The Wayfarer is beautifully packaged for gift-giving, and designed to delight a range of personalities. It’s a perfect gift for all active friends and family members.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Z7eq9ekTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Teabloom","source_asin":"B07GDYX3FY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1138516","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GDYX3FY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GDYX3FY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
