window.products.push({"id":1138623,"name":"GROSCHE Madrid French Press Coffee maker with Bonus REPLACEMENT GLASS BEAKER for French Press.1000 ml 34 fl.oz French Press coffee maker bundle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ptxCl+5DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[ Bold coffee flavor from premium GROSCHE Madrid French Press ] Experience the bold coffee flavors from the quality GROSCHE Madrid French Press. With a fine chrome art deco design, and premium stainless steel filters, the Madrid is our most propular premium French press and chosen by coffee lovers the world over. [ BONUS FREE French Press replacement beaker included ] This combo set includes a Free bonus French Press replacement glass beaker as well. Everyone should have a replacement glass handy for when you need it. Who wants to wait and have to go hunting for a replacement glass beaker when you can get one for Free in this set? [ Fine filter gives you bold and smooth coffee ] the fine filter in the Madrid is perfectly made to give you bold and smooth coffee flavors without building up unsafe pressure when you press the coffee filter. Beware of other stuffing multiple cheap coffee filters into a press, that build up unsafe pressure. One quality filter with coarse ground coffee is the way to go! [ MULTI-PURPOSE as Coffee press or Tea press ] You can use the Madrid for coffee or tea. Always use coarse ground coffee in a French press (1 to 3 tablespoons per mug 300ml). This French press can also brew the best tasting loose leaf or blooming tea by allowing the fullest flavor extraction from the tea. [ MODERN DESIGN ] The design of the Madrid is unique and premium. The minimalist Chrome housing offers a stylish look that is sure to compliment any Kitchen. The bottom of glass beaker never comes in contact with any surface other than the Chrome base, providing protection. The MADRID housing features Tip-Grips that prevent the beaker from slipping out. MADRID surpasses all French presses and offers a difference you’re sure to notice the moment you hold it in your hands!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ptxCl+5DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GROSCHE","source_asin":"B08D4M3QX5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1138623","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08D4M3QX5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08D4M3QX5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
