window.products.push({"id":1138668,"name":"Gourmet Basics Tully 2 Tiered Basket with Banana Hanger","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718Wb9Of65L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Maximize your storage space with this Mikasa Gourmet Basics Tully 2-Tier Basket with Banana Hook. The 2-tier design is perfect for keeping fruits and vegetables, snacks, K-cups, and more neat and easily accessible. Baskets can be used together or separately for customized storage. Hand-crafted from iron for long-lasting beauty, even with everyday use. Air flows through the breathable, open-wire construction, allowing fruits to evenly ripen. Features a banana hook which helps keep bananas fresh and prevents bruising. The antique, black finish complements any décor. Wipe clean with a damp cloth.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718Wb9Of65L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gourmet Basics by Mikasa","source_asin":"B09NMWCGS9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1138668","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NMWCGS9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NMWCGS9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
