window.products.push({"id":1138670,"name":"Vari Electric Standing Desk 60\" x 30\" (Reclaimed Wood 2019)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21XfcFLNazL._AC_.jpg","description":"LARGE WORKSPACE: The Electric Standing Desk boasts more than enough space for multiple monitors, a laptop, and plenty of extra room for your keyboard, mouse, and papers; Add a Vari Table on the side for even more space BUTTON-TOUCH MOVEMENT: With the 3 programmable height settings and the powerful, quiet motor, it's easy to choose a height between 25.5 inch (64.5 cm) to 50.5 inch high (128 cm) QUALITY: We only used commercial-grade materials like heavy-duty laminate and steel, and we included a stability crossbar to make this desk incredibly stable at any height SIMPLE: Assembles easily in 5 minutes without special or complicated tools; We ship the desktop and legs in separate boxes so they can be delivered quickly and easily","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21XfcFLNazL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vari","source_asin":"B079ZBGHYZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1138670","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079ZBGHYZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079ZBGHYZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1138671,"name":"Giantex Modern Accent Chair Set of 2, Upholstered Linen Fabric Single Sofa Armchair with Pillow, Max Load 330lbs, Mid Century Modern Living Room Chair","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":269.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+3jnBbtdS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Comfortable & Spacious Seat: This accent leisure chair is upholstered with soft cushions which are filled with high density sponge and covered with breathable linen, allowing you to sit more comfortably. Besides, featuring a wide and deep seat with elastic spring inside, this armchair provides a firm yet soft support for you. Sturdy & Durable Construction: Supported by sturdy rubber wood legs and solid wood frame, this armchair is stable and strong enough to stand a weight of 330 lbs. What's more, 4 solid wood legs are equipped with anti-slip foot pads to prevent scratches on the floor while keeping the chair stable even on the uneven ground. Ergonomic Backrest & Cozy Waist Pillow: This leisure chair has high and wide backrest and a waist pillow can give you strong support for your whole body, providing great comfort and relieving fatigue when you lean on it. In addition, compared with other wooden armrest, this padded armrest is more comfortable and can better relax your hands. Modern Style & Versatile Design: Made of a simple yet stylish design, this single sofa chair is a good addition to your home and can add a sense of elegance to your living space. You can put this multifunctional accent armchair in your living room, bedroom, balcony, dining room or office to have a rest or have a cup of coffee. Easy to Assemble & Dimensions: This armchair is simple in design and can be put together with ease according to the clear instructions. Since all the parts, necessary hardware and assembly steps are included, the assembly will be very quick. Size of armchair: 30.5\" x 29\" x 33.5\"(L x W x H). Weight capacity of armchair: 330 lbs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+3jnBbtdS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Giantex","source_asin":"B0BWXTMQY4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1138671","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWXTMQY4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWXTMQY4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
