window.products.push({"id":1138689,"name":"VEVOR Heated Towel Rack, 10-Bar Towel Warmer Rack, Wall Mounted Electric Towel Warmer, Electric Towel Drying Rack with Timer, Polished Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":113.24,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51WSNpORx-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Towel Warmer: Our heated towel rack is designed with 10 bars to provide ample enough space to warm your towels and clothes, improving the heating speed at the same time. Superior to other products, our rack comes with stainless steel and is treated with the polishing surface, featuring corrosion-proof, water-proof, and durable use for a long time. Constant & Quick Heating: Better for your use, the towel warmer rack has an intelligent continuous temperature control system, which helps to keep a stable temperature between 113-140 °F. No more than 15 minutes can the warmer reaches the peaking temperature of 140 °F. Besides, this product has an over-heating protection to keep secure. You will not worry about the accidental touch because of the non-scalding feature. Smart Time Control: The electric towel warmer has a built-in digital timer. There is no need to focus on the heating status with its automatic heating mode, saving your time and energy. By pressing the button, the towels will get a total of 4-hour warming and 2-hour resting so that you can get energy-saving and security use. Wall-mounted Installation: Our high-quality electric towel drying rack can be easily installed on the wall. If you want to make your wall looks neat, you can choose the hard-wired way to hide the cables. Otherwise, you will get an effortless setup by selecting a plug-in. Both left and right sides are designed for your assembly. Wide Application: Compatible with homes, hotels, pools, etc., the heated towel warmer is widely applied for different occasions for warming your wet clothes and towels, providing a warm and comfortable feeling after your shower.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51WSNpORx-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VEVOR","source_asin":"B09R7P4TZK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1138689","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09R7P4TZK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09R7P4TZK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
