window.products.push({"id":1138720,"name":"Coral Velvet Bath Mat Beauticon Microfiber Memory Foam Bath Rugs with Anti-Skid Absorbent and Ultra-Soft for Bathrooms, Toilets, Doormat.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717htBx4+EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It is a soft and comfortable mat with features of great water absorbency and anti-slip ability. A great choice for bathrooms and bathtubs that protects your feet from cold floor. The bottom is made of water-proof diving material SBR. It allows to retain water and provides anti-slip function. This kind of material is suitable for different circumstances as it remains the same status no mater in dry or wet and hot or cold environment. Notice: 1. Put the mat in ventilated place and do not expose it to the sun after it absorbs enough water. It's better to use two mats in rotation. 2. If there is water under the mat, its anti-slip function will be weaken, please be more careful when you stand on it under this occasion. 3. About color difference.  Microfiber on the surface might be flattened when stressed, color can be different when the microfiber is erecting or flattened. So usually its color looks lighter or darker. Different light conditions in photographing scene can also lead to color difference. Due to the differences in monitors, actual products may have a slight color difference with the picture. Beauticon spares no effort in providing you a healthy way of living by paying attention to details.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717htBx4+EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BEAUTICON","source_asin":"B075FT3GWH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1138720","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075FT3GWH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075FT3GWH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1138721,"name":"Oscillating Space Heater, Infray 1500W Portable Tower Heater, Fast Heating Ceramic Heater, PTC Electric Heater with Remote Control, 8H Timer, Up and D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61maINEkrxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Quiet & Fast Heating】 Space heater equipped with ceramic heating elements and rated power up to 1500 watts, it can heat up to 70°F in 3 seconds to quickly provide warmth for relatively small spaces. The noise of PTC space heater is lower than 50dB, won’t disturb your sleeping or working while it’s running. 【Auto Oscillation & Angle Adjustable】 Electric fan heater with 90° oscillation to heat from side to side to provide warm to you and your family without wasting heat. It also supports up and down swing, you can choose a suitable angle to enjoy the warm wind. 【Tip Over & Overheat Protection】Tip-Over Protection will shut off the fan heater if it gets knocked over accidentally to avoid accident happened. Overheat Protection system will shut the portable heater off when the parts of the heater overheat. In this way the space heater for indoor use will cool down quickly to avoid overheating. 【Timer & Remote Control】Ceramic heater supports 2-4-8 hours timer function, you can create a time you need to auto turn off the heater and save energy. This tower heater is designed for your safe use, fan heater come with a remote control, you could easily control the heater without getting up from bed or sofa. 【Compact & Portable Heater】 Quiet room heater measures is only about 20.87 inches high, so small and lightweight that you can place it on anywhere in your room or office, designed with a handle for easy moving around. No more concern about taking up too much space in a crowded place. It’s a thoughtful gift for your family & friends to meet the freezing winter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61maINEkrxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"infray","source_asin":"B08H84ZCGG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1138721","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H84ZCGG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08H84ZCGG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
