window.products.push({"id":1138943,"name":"Zinyeme Space Heater, Portable Fireplace Heater, Indoor Electric Freestanding Faux Fire Heaters, Realistic 3D Flame Effect w/ Ember Bed, Overheat/Tip ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZxSAf0dAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔥【Realistic 3D Fireplace Aesthetic】With a 3D flame and bed of burning embers, this tabletop electric heater offers a realistic aesthetic designed to make your room feel warm and cozy. 🔥【Multiple Operating Modes】This electric fireplace has two heating modes: 500W (1,706 BTU) and 1,000W (3,412 BTU), and a fan-only mode to circulate the air. 🔥【Superior Safety】Featuring a tip-over switch and an overheat protection sensor for automatic shut off in the case of overheating, this mini fireplace heater is built for safety. 🔥【Warm and Quiet】The heating range of this heater is 200 sq.ft, and the average heating time is 3 to 5 minutes. The vents at the bottom of the furnace effectively reduce the noise generated by the heater when it is working. The table top heater runs quietly with noise less than 35db. 🔥【Product size】11.8\" x 9.4\" × 5.5\" in, 4.2 lbs. Simply press the power button to turn on the heater, and press the mode button to choose low or high heat mode, and your room will start heating up in seconds.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZxSAf0dAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zinyeme","source_asin":"B0998C82Q9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1138943","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0998C82Q9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0998C82Q9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1138944,"name":"3PC Dumpling Tool Set by Apexchef | Stainless Steel Home Kitchen Manual Dumpling and Ravioli Molds with Dough Cutter (Small+Large+Cutter)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41v2FqPIlJL._AC_.jpg","description":"Dumplings, picture perfect little pouches erupting with flavor that captivate the young and old alike. But who wants to spend hours in the kitchen winding up with dumplings that are… well… disappointing?This is why everybody needs an Apexchef 3 Piece Dumpling Tool Set! This set conveniently helps you make your very own dumplings from the comfort of your own home. No more fumbling with wrappers or getting your fingers messy. Just place the dumpling wrap on the mold, fill and press to make extraordinary Chinese dumplings! Making the best dumplings, empanadas, pot stickers and ravioli can be completed in four easy steps! 1. Cut - Cut dumpling or ravioli wraps with the cutter tool. 2. Place - Place dough wrapper on the open press and add your favorite filling.  3. Moisten - Moisten the edges of wrapper with water and press firmly to close and seal. 4. Remove - Remove your finished dumpling from the mold and boil, bake or pan fry according to recipe.The Apexchef 3 Piece Dumpling Tool Set is a great tool to get kids involved in the cooking process. With endless possibilities for fillings it can encourage young ones to try new foods and expand their horizons! The larger mold is perfect for making calzones! Just fill the dough with your favorite savory ingredients and you have an excellent lunch or snack that can be eaten on the go! This set includes a large mould, small mould and a dumpling dough cutter tool, all made from food grade 304 stainless steel making the entire set extremely durable. Stop wasting money on expensive take out calzones and dumplings or store bought ravioli and DIY at home!  Apexchef is so confident in our product that if for any reason you are dissatisfied, simply return it with our full 100% money back guarantee. Grab an Apexchef 3 Piece Dumpling Tool Set today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41v2FqPIlJL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Apexchef","source_asin":"B07WRR9DWS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1138944","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WRR9DWS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WRR9DWS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
